ord bought on a forum and a person patient enough to use it quietly. That is how six in ten of the intrusions we handle begin."}</p><h2 className={"font-semibold tracking-[-0.025em]"}>{"02:14 · Something small"}</h2><p>{"A new device enrolled under a finance manager's account. On its own, that happens a hundred times a day across our customers. The AI scored it low and kept watching."}</p><h2 className={"font-semibold tracking-[-0.025em]"}>{"02:15 · Three small things"}</h2><p>{"Within a minute the same account created a mailbox rule that hid any message containing \"invoice\", then signed in from a country it had never used. Three quiet signals, one session. That is the moment a case is born."}</p><div className={"custom-timeline custom-ar-timeline my-10"} role={"group"} aria-label={"The detection timeline for this incident"}><div className={"custom-timeline-head"}><span className={"custom-timeline-icon"} aria-hidden={"true"}><i className={"ph ph-pulse"}></i></span><span className={"custom-timeline-who grid min-w-0 leading-[1.3]"}><strong className={"text-[1rem]"}>{"Detection Timeline"}</strong><span className={"overflow-hidden text-[0.9375rem] text-(--custom-muted) whitespace-nowrap"}>{"Northwind Freight · finance"}</span></span></div><ol className={"custom-timeline-body"}><li className={"custom-event custom-event--low"}><time className={"custom-event-time"} datetime={"02:14:07"}>{"02:14:07"}</time><span className={"custom-event-dot"} aria-hidden={"true"}></span><span className={"custom-event-text"}>{"New device enrolled"}</span><span className={"custom-event-host"}>{"hr-mac-03"}</span></li><li className={"custom-event custom-event--low"}><time className={"custom-event-time"} datetime={"02:14:31"}>{"02:14:31"}</time><span className={"custom-event-dot"} aria-hidden={"true"}></span><span className={"custom-event-text"}>{"Mailbox rule created"}</span><span className={"custom-event-host"}>{"m.ortega"}</span></li><li className={"custom-event custom-event--medium"}><time className={"custom-event-time"} datetime={"02:15:02"}>{"02:15:02"}</time><span className={"custom-event-dot"} aria-hidden={"true"}></span><span className={"custom-event-text"}>{"Sign-in from a new country"}</span><span className={"custom-event-host"}>{"vpn-gw-2"}</span></li><li className={"custom-event custom-event--critical"}><time className={"custom-event-time"} datetime={"02:15:40"}>{"02:15:40"}</time><span className={"custom-event-dot"} aria-hidden={"true"}></span><span className={"custom-event-text"}>{"Credential misuse "}<span className={"custom-sev custom-sev--critical"}>{"Critical"}</span></span><span className={"custom-event-host"}>{"finance-laptop-14"}</span></li></ol><p className={"custom-timeline-result"}><span className={"custom-timeline-result-icon"} aria-hidden={"true"}><i className={"ph-bold ph-check"}></i></span><span>{"Contained in "}<strong>{"6 min 12 s"}</strong></span><time className={"custom-event-time"} datetime={"02:21:52"}>{"02:21:52"}</time></p></div><h2 className={"font-semibold tracking-[-0.025em]"}>{"02:16 · A person takes the case"}</h2><p>{"Our AI linked the signals with 97% confidence and wrote down why. Then it did what it always does with a case like this: it handed it to a person. Aoife, three hours into her Dublin shift, had it open 40 seconds later."}</p><blockquote className={"font-heading text-[1.5rem] leading-[1.35] tracking-[-0.015em] border-l-0"}><p>{"\"The AI tells me what it saw. I decide what it means. At two in the morning, that split is the whole job.\""}</p><cite className={"font-sans text-[1rem] font-normal text-(--custom-signal)"}>{"Aoife Brennan, Senior Analyst, Dublin"}</cite></blockquote><h2 className={"font-semibold tracking-[-0.025em]"}>{"02:21 · Contained"}</h2><p>{"She revoked every session on the account, forced a password reset, deleted the mailbox rule and isolated the laptop. The customer's IT director woke up to a one-page summary instead of a crisis."}</p><figure><img className={"w-full aspect-[16/10] 